1
00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:02.740
[S01] If you want to be wealthy and happy the rest of your life,

2
00:00:02.819 --> 00:00:06.120
[S01] just learn this lesson well.

3
00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:12.119
[S01] Learn to work harder on yourself than you do on your job.

4
00:00:12.279 --> 00:00:17.120
[S01] I have found in my experience that income does not far exceed personal development.

5
00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:19.440
[S01] Now, sometimes income takes a lucky jump,

6
00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:22.039
[S01] but sure enough, unless you grow out where it is,

7
00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:23.920
[S01] it'll usually come back where you are.

8
00:00:24.039 --> 00:00:25.519
[S01] Life has strange ways.

9
00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:27.320
[S01] If somebody hands you a million dollars,

10
00:00:27.379 --> 00:00:29.120
[S01] best you become a millionaire quickly.

11
00:00:29.739 --> 00:00:31.320
[S01] So you get to keep the money.

12
00:00:32.259 --> 00:00:35.039
[S01] Otherwise, sure enough, it'll disappear.

13
00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:36.840
[S01] Somebody once said,

14
00:00:37.109 --> 00:00:39.240
[S01] "If you took all the money in the world,

15
00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:41.759
[S01] divided it up equally among everybody,

16
00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:44.920
[S01] it would soon all be back in the same pockets."

17
00:00:45.119 --> 00:00:48.520
[S01] Success is something you attract, not something you pursue.

18
00:00:48.719 --> 00:00:50.240
[S01] So instead of going after it,

19
00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:53.039
[S01] you work on yourself, personal development.

20
00:00:53.159 --> 00:00:57.039
[S01] Because true happiness is not contained in what you get.

21
00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:00.439
[S01] Happiness is contained in what you become.

22
00:01:00.759 --> 00:01:04.159
[S01] Now, if you're excited and you're ready to change,

23
00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:07.359
[S01] let me give you three steps to start life change

24
00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:10.280
[S01] that can change your life, your personality, your lifestyle.

25
00:01:10.310 --> 00:01:11.439
[S01] Everything can change.

26
00:01:11.799 --> 00:01:12.519
[S01] Here's the steps.

27
00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:20.840
[S01] Number one, find out how things work.

28
00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:23.920
[S01] To change your life, really, you need ideas.

29
00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:27.640
[S01] There isn't anything an idea can't change.

30
00:01:28.439 --> 00:01:31.040
[S01] And Schoff taught me the major problem is lack of an idea.

31
00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:32.120
[S01] Not a problem.

32
00:01:33.519 --> 00:01:34.640
[S01] At first, I didn't have any money.

33
00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:36.079
[S01] I said to Mr. Schoff, "I don't have any money."

34
00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:37.319
[S01] He said, "That's not a problem."

35
00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:39.319
[S01] Now, see, up until then, I always thought it was.

36
00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:40.359
[S01] Right?

37
00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:41.560
[S01] I was confused.

38
00:01:42.519 --> 00:01:45.519
[S01] He said, "No, no, the problem is lack of an idea

39
00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:47.400
[S01] on how to create money and wealth."

40
00:01:47.799 --> 00:01:50.079
[S01] It isn't lack of money, it's lack of ideas.

41
00:01:50.159 --> 00:01:52.319
[S01] So if you get the ideas, see, you can change anything.

42
00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:56.040
[S01] Now, to get ideas, you need a constant study of finding out.

43
00:01:56.760 --> 00:02:00.760
[S01] If you wish to be successful, study success.

44
00:02:01.239 --> 00:02:04.120
[S01] If you wish to be happy, study happiness.

45
00:02:04.719 --> 00:02:07.879
[S01] If you wish to be wealthy, study wealth.

46
00:02:08.439 --> 00:02:10.189
[S01] Don't leave it to chance.

47
00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:12.319
[S01] Make it a study.

48
00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:16.039
[S01] Some people just go through the day with their fingers crossed.

49
00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:18.240
[S01] See, that won't do it.

50
00:02:18.759 --> 00:02:20.159
[S01] You've got to study the things

51
00:02:20.189 --> 00:02:24.240
[S01] that can change your economic, social, spiritual, personal life.

52
00:02:25.189 --> 00:02:28.039
[S01] Now, Schoff also said, "When you find out something that works,

53
00:02:28.319 --> 00:02:30.909
[S01] put the information in your journal."

54
00:02:31.629 --> 00:02:33.680
[S01] Don't use your head for a filing cabinet.

55
00:02:34.909 --> 00:02:37.800
[S01] Put it in your journal so that you can do the next best thing.

56
00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:40.629
[S01] Repetition, repetition, repetition.

57
00:02:40.719 --> 00:02:41.759
[S01] Go over it.

58
00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:44.719
[S01] And if you repeat it, go over it, sure enough,

59
00:02:44.759 --> 00:02:46.680
[S01] someday, some mysterious day,

60
00:02:46.919 --> 00:02:48.840
[S01] the idea takes root, starts to grow,

61
00:02:48.879 --> 00:02:50.520
[S01] and shows up in your bank account

62
00:02:50.599 --> 00:02:53.639
[S01] and your dress and your personality and your lifestyle.

63
00:02:54.960 --> 00:02:56.639
[S01] Now, if you're curious,

64
00:02:57.319 --> 00:03:03.039
[S01] let me give you three ways to find out how to change anything.

65
00:03:03.919 --> 00:03:06.240
[S01] Any life direction, any dimension.

66
00:03:06.319 --> 00:03:08.759
[S01] Here's three ways to find out how to change anything.

67
00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:11.520
[S01] Number one is to read.

68
00:03:11.599 --> 00:03:14.240
[S01] All of the successful people I know and work with around the world,

69
00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:15.439
[S01] they're all good readers.

70
00:03:15.759 --> 00:03:17.319
[S01] Curiosity drives them to read.

71
00:03:17.439 --> 00:03:18.479
[S01] They gotta know.

72
00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:21.360
[S01] They just read, read, read, read, read, read, read, read, read.

73
00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:23.639
[S01] Become self-educated.

74
00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:26.879
[S01] Standard education will get you standard results.

75
00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:30.639
[S01] And you can check those numbers and see if that's what you want.

76
00:03:30.719 --> 00:03:31.919
[S01] But if you want to go beyond that,

77
00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:34.319
[S01] you now have got to become self-educated.

78
00:03:34.439 --> 00:03:36.639
[S01] One way to learn is from your own experiences.

79
00:03:36.759 --> 00:03:40.879
[S01] But another way to learn is from other people's experiences.

80
00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:47.479
[S01] See, one book might save you five years if you read it.

81
00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:51.520
[S01] Did you know there's books on how to be stronger, more decisive?

82
00:03:51.639 --> 00:03:53.319
[S01] Be a speaker, be a leader.

83
00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:54.879
[S01] Have a better effect on other people.

84
00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:56.159
[S01] Develop your personality.

85
00:03:56.240 --> 00:03:57.680
[S01] Did you know there's books on that?

86
00:03:57.879 --> 00:04:00.560
[S01] Did you know that hundreds of successful people

87
00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:02.360
[S01] have written their stories in books

88
00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:04.919
[S01] and they wrote down how they did it?

89
00:04:05.039 --> 00:04:07.439
[S01] And people don't read it?

90
00:04:07.639 --> 00:04:09.039
[S01] How would you explain that?

91
00:04:10.039 --> 00:04:11.879
[S01] Now, you don't have to read half the night,

92
00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:14.639
[S01] but put this in your notes, 30 minutes a day.

93
00:04:15.240 --> 00:04:16.319
[S01] 30 minutes a day.

94
00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:18.639
[S01] Read something positive, something challenging,

95
00:04:18.680 --> 00:04:21.040
[S01] something inspirational, something instructional.

96
00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:22.680
[S01] At least 30 minutes a day.

97
00:04:22.879 --> 00:04:25.389
[S01] Become a good reader.

98
00:04:25.639 --> 00:04:26.829
[S01] Now, that's my opinion.

99
00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:29.680
[S01] Listen to the other lecturers and listen to me

100
00:04:29.720 --> 00:04:30.949
[S01] and make up your own mind.

101
00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:33.879
[S01] Don't be a follower, be a student.

102
00:04:34.439 --> 00:04:36.829
[S01] Here's the second way to find out how to change your life.

103
00:04:38.319 --> 00:04:39.829
[S01] And that's to listen.

104
00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:42.720
[S01] Get around successful people and listen.

105
00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:46.120
[S01] Now, you can also learn from unsuccessful people.

106
00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:47.439
[S01] Take notes on both.

107
00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:49.949
[S01] Negative and positive.

108
00:04:50.079 --> 00:04:52.639
[S01] Find out what poor people read and don't read it.

109
00:06:00.079 --> 00:06:01.120
[S02] ...people out to dinner.

110
00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:05.120
[S02] Now, here's the third way to find out how to change your life.

111
00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:07.680
[S02] And that's to observe.

112
00:06:09.759 --> 00:06:11.839
[S02] You can pick up a lot of ideas just by watching.

113
00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:14.399
[S02] Get around successful people and watch.

114
00:06:15.839 --> 00:06:16.639
[S02] Here's why.

115
00:06:16.879 --> 00:06:20.230
[S02] Success leaves clues.

116
00:06:22.240 --> 00:06:24.319
[S02] Watch how the man shakes hands.

117
00:06:24.800 --> 00:06:26.240
[S02] Watch how the lady responds.

118
00:06:26.879 --> 00:06:31.360
[S02] People who do well do certain things over and over and over and over.

119
00:06:31.360 --> 00:06:33.759
[S02] And if you're clever, you can pick them up.

120
00:06:36.149 --> 00:06:37.040
[S02] Watch it all.

121
00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:40.560
[S02] If a guy's making $10,000 a month, I'd watch how he walks.

122
00:06:40.959 --> 00:06:41.920
[S02] Maybe that's it.

123
00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:44.240
[S02] Copy his funny little walk.

124
00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:47.439
[S02] Somebody says, "Well, that's kind of a silly walk."

125
00:06:47.439 --> 00:06:49.040
[S02] Say, "It's $10,000."

126
00:06:52.639 --> 00:06:54.879
[S02] "I haven't got the money yet, but I got the walk."

127
00:06:55.920 --> 00:06:57.759
[S02] It's bound to start somewhere.

128
00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:03.360
[S02] What I ask you tonight is to be unusual and be a good observer of what's going on.

129
00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:06.230
[S02] You can pick up ideas that can change your life, starting tomorrow.

130
00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:08.079
[S02] Just be a more careful observer.

131
00:07:08.079 --> 00:07:09.759
[S02] Now, remember, there's two ways to see.

132
00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:12.949
[S02] One is called sight.

133
00:07:14.399 --> 00:07:15.519
[S02] See with your eyes.

134
00:07:15.839 --> 00:07:18.720
[S02] The other one is called insight.

135
00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:20.879
[S02] See with your mind.

136
00:07:24.639 --> 00:07:26.240
[S02] See with your eyes, you'll see things.

137
00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:28.240
[S02] See with your mind, you'll see answers.

138
00:07:30.079 --> 00:07:32.480
[S02] Put your eyes and your mind to work.

139
00:07:34.319 --> 00:07:38.879
[S02] And the best advice on developing sight and insight is pay attention.

140
00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:40.959
[S02] Don't miss anything.

141
00:07:41.279 --> 00:07:44.160
[S02] Wherever you are, be there.

142
00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:46.480
[S02] Excellent.

143
00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:50.959
[S02] Now, we've lingered a little bit long on number one here for personal development.

144
00:07:52.160 --> 00:07:55.680
[S02] Find out how things work, but it's so very important finding out.

145
00:07:56.079 --> 00:07:57.920
[S02] And I've given you three ways to find out.

146
00:08:00.720 --> 00:08:02.720
[S02] Now, here's the second step to personal development.

147
00:08:06.560 --> 00:08:08.639
[S02] Okay, number one, let's find out how things work.

148
00:08:08.959 --> 00:08:10.079
[S02] Here's number two.

149
00:08:10.470 --> 00:08:11.279
[S02] Go to work.

150
00:08:11.910 --> 00:08:14.079
[S02] If there's one thing to get excited over, that's it.

151
00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:20.399
[S02] Get excited over your ability to make yourself do the necessary things.

152
00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:26.079
[S02] What did you make yourself do, starting tomorrow, that would change it all?

153
00:08:26.079 --> 00:08:28.079
[S02] No, tell.

154
00:08:29.189 --> 00:08:31.040
[S02] Now, see, that's exciting.

155
00:08:31.519 --> 00:08:35.440
[S02] On any given day, you can massively change the direction of your life.

156
00:08:36.159 --> 00:08:37.440
[S02] Now, here's the key to discipline.

157
00:08:38.159 --> 00:08:39.840
[S02] Start with the little disciplines.

158
00:08:39.840 --> 00:08:41.909
[S02] Get excited over the little disciplines.

159
00:08:42.799 --> 00:08:45.600
[S02] And get right on those, because those will lead to the big ones.

160
00:08:46.240 --> 00:08:49.279
[S02] You can't handle the big challenges in life unless you take on the little ones.

161
00:08:49.519 --> 00:08:51.200
[S02] Make a list of all the things you can do.

162
00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:52.159
[S02] Get right on those.

163
00:08:52.159 --> 00:08:53.600
[S02] Discipline yourself for those.

164
00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:56.639
[S02] Both for the results and for the muscle and for the practice.

165
00:08:56.879 --> 00:08:59.600
[S02] So that when life hands you some big challenges, you'll be ready.

166
00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:00.879
[S02] You'll have the muscle.

167
00:09:02.159 --> 00:09:07.039
[S02] But see, if you don't handle the small ones, you can't take care of the big ones.

168
00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:10.399
[S02] Here's what else it takes for life change.

169
00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:12.159
[S02] Self-motivation.

170
00:09:12.799 --> 00:09:14.720
[S02] Key phrase, self-motivation.

171
00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:17.519
[S02] I don't know why we call it self-motivation.

172
00:09:17.519 --> 00:09:18.639
[S02] It's really the only kind there is.

173
00:09:18.639 --> 00:09:20.080
[S02] You've got to motivate yourself.

174
00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:25.919
[S02] And you don't want to give self-motivation away to somebody else and make it somebody else motivating you.

175
00:09:27.360 --> 00:09:31.519
[S02] The guy says, "Boy, if somebody just come by and turn me on."

176
00:09:31.679 --> 00:09:33.279
[S02] What if they don't show up?

177
00:09:34.879 --> 00:09:37.919
[S02] See, you've got to have a better plan for your life.

178
00:09:39.679 --> 00:09:43.120
[S02] You must now take action on what you found out.

179
00:09:44.159 --> 00:09:46.879
[S02] Don't let your learning lead to knowledge.

180
00:09:46.879 --> 00:09:48.159
[S02] You'll become a fool.

181
00:09:48.960 --> 00:09:51.279
[S02] Let your learning lead to action.

182
00:09:51.279 --> 00:09:52.639
[S02] You can become wealthy.

183
00:09:54.559 --> 00:09:56.080
[S02] And there's many kinds of wealth.

184
00:09:56.080 --> 00:09:57.200
[S02] I understand that.

185
00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:58.240
[S02] Not just money.

186
00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:00.320
[S02] Money's one of the least of all values.

187
00:10:01.919 --> 00:10:06.000
[S02] I know some people with a lot of money that are very poor.

188
00:10:09.039 --> 00:10:10.879
[S02] Now, here's the third step to personal development.

189
00:10:10.879 --> 00:10:12.480
[S02] And we'll wrap up personal development.

190
00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:16.159
[S02] Step number three.
